      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nnonisolated\nfunc continueAsynchronousWorkOnMainThread(_ block: @escaping () -> Void)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nnonisolated\nfunc continueAsynchronousWorkOnMainThread(_ block: @escaping () -> Void)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "edf408794c124861544ffe0b60ea074c7143f291c0abc4b1786d8afebabc43c8",
