    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "If the main thread is blocked by an invocation of [`performActivity(withSynchronousWaiting:using:)`](nsdocument/performactivity(withsynchronouswaiting:using:).md) or [`performSynchronousFileAccess(_:)`](nsdocument/performsynchronousfileaccess(_:).md), this method interrupts that blocking activity, performs the specified `block`, and then resumes the blocking activity after `block` returns.",
      "ko": "메인 스레드가 [`performActivity(withSynchronousWaiting:using:)`](nsdocument/performactivity(withsynchronouswaiting:using:).md) 또는 [`performSynchronousFileAccess(_:)`](nsdocument/performsynchronousfileaccess(_:).md)의 호출로 블로킹된 경우, 이 메서드는 해당 블로킹 활동을 중단하고 지정된 `block`을 실행한 뒤 `block`이 반환되면 블로킹 활동을 다시 재개합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "68cfa50366588449e64d9c38f0d1b28828f37637af840f688656c6aa38158719",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Invocations of this method always return before the passed-in block is invoked.",
      "ko": "이 메서드의 호출은 전달된 `block`이 호출되기 전에 항상 반환됩니다. 비메인 스레드에서 작업이 진행 중이고 그 일부를 메인 스레드에서 계속 처리해야 할 때 이 메서드를 호출할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b611fc7f2f8a96e403aaaeab7bd019fb01084c51bf776840d9c561a952423b80",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "You can invoke this method when work is being done on a non-main thread and part of the work must be continued on the main thread.",
      "ko": "Note that if you are using the `NSDocument` default undo/redo features, setting the document’s edited status by updating the change count happens automatically.",
      "sourceHash": "65fcb3c1db3f2b1b884aa6623396f32b4748965184639040dce3832d9277ca94",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "For example, [`save(to:ofType:for:completionHandler:)`](nsdocument/save(to:oftype:for:completionhandler:).md) uses this method when it has just completed the actual writing of the file during asynchronous saving and, to finish the saving operation, must invoke [`updateChangeCount(withToken:for:)`](nsdocument/updatechangecount(withtoken:for:).md) and other methods on the main thread.",
      "ko": "예를 들어, [`save(to:ofType:for:completionHandler:)`](nsdocument/save(to:oftype:for:completionhandler:).md) 메서드는 비동기 저장 중 파일 쓰기가 실제로 완료된 직후에 이 메서드를 사용하며, 저장 작업을 완료하려면 메인 스레드에서 [`updateChangeCount(withToken:for:)`](nsdocument/updatechangecount(withtoken:for:).md) 및 기타 메서드를 호출해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d54ad72311e53b4038cce02030aec62fd27855bdb7365bbba8b55606cfb2e32a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This method can be invoked on any thread.",
      "ko": "이 메서드는 임의의 스레드에서 호출할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "623ef1f6b048fbb97e45d386ce22e7348ba5c97fbb7f1e30bd062e12dc7b1f21",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
